        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's how the second half of the song goes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "How sad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now Damian's gone, and he won't even get a decent burial...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They'd never give him back to us. All they'd do is scorch him to ash, scatter him off the city, treat him like the dirt under anyone's foot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Soft sobbing)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "First it was Lowry, then it was Chris, and now they've caught hold of Damian too. Grainne, when Sean got arrested, they all said he'd caught Oripathy\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Ronan, don't go on. Sean... he just caught it being careless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was a hardworking, loyal man. A poor, poor man, and the only thing he ever wanted was just a better life for me and my son...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Grainne, haven't you figured it out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're just a bunch of rivets to them. Of course they'll toss us away without a care when we rust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "And even if we haven't rusted, so long as we don't fit too well in the city's machines, we've got the same fate coming. Nothing changes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "They never gave a shit we were catching Oripathy one by one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every month they give out those drugs, the other workers get their whole lot, and we can only expect a half. Maybe even a third.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the protective suits. How long has Sean been wearing his for? Five years? Bloody hell, seven? How many times have you snuck out of bed at night just to patch it up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "All those laws, all those standards, just for their benefit. And us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're only fit to eat the potatoes and the rotten apples they don't want. Means nothing that the ag plates of this city soak in our sweat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're only fit to waste away our lives day and night in the factories, and once we can't work a day more, we fall ill one by one just like they wanted!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way this is going, it's like they're sitting there playing dominoes, wiping us Tarans off our own city\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop it... I'm begging you. Ronan, nothing you're saying will lead to any good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just look at Cliodhna and her kin stood over there. Crying over their own son, their own brother. How many more loves do you want lost, how many more hurting over what your anger did for them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the murderers that brought this hurt. They're killing us one after another. Times it's with sickness, times it's with mortar shells. Grainne, don't you deceive yourself any longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Low voice) This morning, a few came looking for me. The O'Briens, and Conor's brother. They've decided to join us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been hard getting by for you and your kid, we understand. This is a big moment, and we need to help each other now more than ever...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd better keep far from me and my child, Ronan... seeing as my Sean got on well enough with your lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go, Grainne. You see that one over there? She's wearing that uniform.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know our rules. I trust in you, and I'm asking you to trust me more. If you've made up your mind, you can tell Saoirse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
