    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... hello.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know Barry's, er, Damian Barry's family?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Shakes head)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard you singin' just now. I'm not in the wrong place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't know what you're searching about for, but Damian's ma and sister know nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then did he have any especially good friends, or anyone who worked at the warehouse with him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We know nothing... That's the truth...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -100,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Whimper*... I'm begging you! Please don't take me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Sorry... did I get too close? I've got no intentions of hurtin' you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "You seem awful scared of me. Is somethin' on my face?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "N... Nothing at all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'll allow me, I need to go home. I still have so much fruit from this morning, and it'll go rotten in no time, if I leave it alone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
