    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? Is that... Captain Kelly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name2": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cliodhna, I just want to see you for one moment. I want to know if you and Fiona are still alright...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it was my mistake, but\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "My hands were tied...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I remember, I remember it all. Damian... he was the boy of my sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I watched him grow up his whole life. The day I was transferred back from Peninsula to Hillock, he set an edelweiss in my cap with his own two hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was still so little then... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry... I shouldn't be telling you all this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right... I've been good for nothing. I haven't the face to return here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't in time to stop him when he got involved with that group... and I couldn't disobey the Colonel's orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not just that, I have to do this. This is all for County Hillock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I love you all, and I love this city... I can't just stand goggling while that bunch tear our home to pieces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand, Cliodhna, my sister, and I'm not asking your forgiveness or anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll... be going, then. You... you and Fiona be sure to take care of yourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can find the time tomorrow, I'll come see you again...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
