    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "name2": "avg_npc_240",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And what's that ball in your hands for... oh, forget it, you're always gripping that ball wherever you go. Were you off looking for Conor's brother again? Oh, you... Ronan's told you, hasn't he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at your hands, all covered in black. It's like you were digging through a mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You come with me to the morning market from now on. You can't go looking for them around this time anymore... I can't let you become like them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sorrowful Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Traitor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boy... wasn't one bit wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Captain stands still for a moment, repeating the word, once, twice to himself, finally turning to leave."
    },
    {
        "text": "His head is hung low as could be, and he doesn't meet the gaze of a single person more, including those young colleagues of him that rush his way."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on a moment, Captain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_policewhistle",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014What are you all doing here? Pack off home, if you know what's good for you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've told you, you're not allowed to congregate on the streets at this time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is our home! It's not us who should go packing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Embittered Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Who had the lip to say that just now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 10,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.51,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are these... Wilted leaves?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "Step forward right now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 10,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.51,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "You Tara rabble, watch I don't\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241"
    },
