    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Brandishin' a bolt on the street's far too dangerous!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who're you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I'm here on orders. Come to investigate the case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're here for the murder at the bar?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, what murder?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This rabble right here. They've killed plenty of ours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Damian Barry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, I hear he's been put to death already. I suppose it was you lot who caught him? Nicely done, thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We didn't know yet when we caught him... was he really part of the spectre force? Er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who gives a shake what he was? Serves him right he's dead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you hear me? No\u2014congregating! Each and all of you up to whatever secret business here, you'll all be treated as suspects!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 10,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.51,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You bloody Tara arselickers\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't! Don't get carried away! Look, most of 'em are just plain city folk, with a loved one dead, and they're here grievin' for him, like human nature would.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 10,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.51,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh\u2014a\u2014a rotten potato?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha ha, see? You spoke for them, and you got battered, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're so keen on staying here, stay. As long as I make sure this rabble behaves itself, I'm done. My rotten luck for getting this patrol duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You riff-raff, I'll say it again, no congregating!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_policewhistle",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
