    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Send notice one more time, please. I want to see Colonel Hamilton.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Colonel's handling urgent affairs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You said that two hours ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already abided by strict process. I submitted description of my duty yesterday when entering County Hillock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the Colonel won't let us take part in suspect interrogations, and goes to lengths to execute them beforehand, and presently refuses my request to meet him\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "To anyone else, don't you think this conduct might be taken as a deliberate hindrance to our fulfillment of orders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no authority to answer your question, Lieutenant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's fine. I'll say my part, and it's enough if someone listens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've said before, the Originium products thieved are not small in number. It's sufficient arms to allow a detachment to attack a small town, or bomb a medium nomadic city's support tracks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who'd want to obtain these products?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ordinary bandits wouldn't need them; it'd cost too much to smuggle them out. With Victorian military goods in this great a bulk, even a Sargon black market under Columbia's protection wouldn't dare provide a means for a deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who else is left? A local private arms dealer, moneymaking off the costs of remodeling? They haven't got the appetite, let alone the guts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only a well-trained unit, well-versed in military methods would dare take it, and could evade our spies on top.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "If this unit got hold of that large a quantity of Originium product, what would their goal be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Conspiracy to overthrow? Taking the chance to embezzle far removed from Londinium, colluding with outside powers to fill their pockets, slowly and steadily?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lieutenant...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to panic, this is all just baseless reasoning, no thanks to whoever's keeping me waiting. I can't get anything done like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
